WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.941
Clear goals shape motivation by giving effort a direction.

00:00:02.941 --> 00:00:07.360
Vague goals often fail because they do not tell people what to do next,

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:09.885
how to recognize progress, or when to adjust.

00:00:09.885 --> 00:00:12.726
A goal like improve the process may sound useful,

00:00:12.726 --> 00:00:17.461
but it is hard to act on until it becomes specific enough to guide behavior.

00:00:17.461 --> 00:00:21.565
Clear goals reduce ambiguity and make it easier to choose the next step.

00:00:21.565 --> 00:00:24.090
Outcome goals and process goals serve different purposes.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:28.194
An outcome goal describes the result people want, such as finishing a project,

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:30.088
improving quality, or passing an assessment.

00:00:30.088 --> 00:00:32.929
A process goal describes actions under the person's control,

00:00:32.929 --> 00:00:37.348
such as reviewing one design each day, practicing a skill for a set time,

00:00:37.348 --> 00:00:38.926
or documenting the next decision.

00:00:38.926 --> 00:00:42.083
Process goals are powerful because they convert intention into behavior.

00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:43.030
Expectancy matters too.

00:00:43.030 --> 00:00:46.818
People invest more effort when they believe success is possible through action.

00:00:46.818 --> 00:00:49.027
If the goal feels impossible, motivation drops.

00:00:49.027 --> 00:00:50.921
If it feels trivial, attention drifts.

00:00:50.921 --> 00:00:55.972
Useful design creates near-term targets and milestones that stretch capability without making the path feel hopeless.

00:00:55.972 --> 00:01:00.707
Progress signals help people see that effort is producing movement before the final outcome arrives.

00:01:00.707 --> 00:01:03.547
Feedback loops sustain motivation by connecting behavior to results.

00:01:03.547 --> 00:01:07.335
The faster and clearer the feedback, the easier it is to adjust.

00:01:07.335 --> 00:01:10.176
This does not mean every task needs constant scoring.

00:01:10.176 --> 00:01:15.227
It means people need some way to know whether they are moving in the right direction.

00:01:15.227 --> 00:01:19.015
Visible progress can carry people through difficult work because it turns effort

00:01:19.015 --> 00:01:21.540
from a vague hope into an observable pattern.
